        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. The age ratio clause in the Agreement calls for the employment of an additional employee or employees on the basis of age. Therefore, the Business Manager shall refer the first applicant on the register satisfying the applicable age requirements; provided however, that all names in higher priority groups, if any, shall first be exhausted before such over-age reference can be made.",
